          "angle": 180,
          "portId": "root"
        }
      ],
      "ports": [
        {
          "id": "root",
          "key": "root",
          "label": "root",
          "direction": "input",
          "dataType": "any",
          "angle": 180,
          "metadata": {
            "interface": true,
            "structural": true,
            "role": "content.root"
          }
        }
      ],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "workboard-class",
          "nodeId": "workboard"
        },
        "markdown": "## Workboard policy\n\nThe controller owns graph-local projection policy. Source task graphs continue to own task status, priority, and the work itself. Portal carriers own local `data.board` placement overrides.\n\n- `laneMode: auto` follows the status-to-lane mapping.\n- `laneMode: manual` preserves the carrier's selected lane.\n- For now, pinning and manual placement are the same state: pinned carriers use `laneMode: manual`; unpinned carriers use `laneMode: auto`.\n- Rank remains local projection data, not source-task truth.",
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "## Workboard policy\n\nThe controller owns graph-local projection policy. Source task graphs continue to own task status, priority, and the work itself. Portal carriers own local `data.board` placement overrides.\n\n- `laneMode: auto` follows the status-to-lane mapping.\n- `laneMode: manual` preserves the carrier's selected lane.\n- For now, pinning and manual placement are the same state: pinned carriers use `laneMode: manual`; unpinned carriers use `laneMode: auto`.\n- Rank remains local projection data, not source-task truth."
        },
        "renderShape": {
          "kind": "markdown"
        }
      }
    },
